  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>e</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>g</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>a</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>d</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>g</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>b</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>e</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>h</mi></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>c</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>f</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>i</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math></p><p>Diagonal elements of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>T</mi></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>is</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>d</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>.</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p>Sum <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>e</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>g</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>h</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>Case</td>\t\t\t<td>No. of Matrices</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(1)</td>\t\t\t<td>All &ndash; <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(2)</td>\t\t\t<td>One <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>3</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>,&nbsp;remaining-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>9</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(3)</td>\t\t\t<td>\t\t\t<p>One-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>2</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>\t\t\t<p>Five-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>\t\t\t<p>Three-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></p>\t\t\t</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>63</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(4)</td>\t\t\t<td>Two -<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br />\t\t\tOne-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mn>1</mn><mo>'</mo></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math><br />\t\t\tSix-<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>0</mn><mo>&#39;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Then, the total no. of ways <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>63</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>766</mn></math></p>"
